            text: _("With care, Arinexis, with care! Fire dussst is ssstrewn about."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Dragons, do not breath on thisss dussst!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Fire Dust... enough to bring down this cave behind us..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("... a <b>cave</b>."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Gorlack, you know we must brave it... We shall do this. Together. You delivered me from <b><i>that</i></b> cave alive. I swear to you, Gorlack, I shall now repay you in kind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Resha... about <b><i>that</i></b> cave... there is someth—"),
          },
